{"4979510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Build & Bail", "steam_appid": 4979510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build traps and race your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD &amp; BAIL is a 3D party platformer for 2-6 players. Before every race, everyone secretly places a trap or platform on the track, then you all race at the same time. Round after round there are more traps in the way and the race gets more chaotic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How a round works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, each player selects a piece from a random list of all available pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/3b2de6afa6fc89281d90736db3614770.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=421 /></span><br>Then, each player places their piece anywhere on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/c69db8586e3c4c57dceaeb0c1ffac989.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once everything is in place, the new pieces are revealed and the race begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/8295b65852f92ba66759ce67fb03caa7.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your track, your chaos</strong> New traps arrive every round. By the end, the track is a minefield made of your own ideas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A nasty arsenal</strong> Saw blades, pendulums, cannons, wind cannons, jump traps, honey fields, ice patches and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy movement</strong> Double jump, wall jump, dash. Easy to learn, but fast players stay in front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracks that go up</strong> Candy towers, neon rooftops, glaciers, lava fields, desert ruins. Always with multiple routes and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your rules</strong> Score target, rounds, respawns, player collision, sudden death: the host decides how mean it gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character workshop</strong> Colour, hat, face. Look your best before you fall into the lava.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play together</strong> Steam lobbies: invite friends, share a code or open a public lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short rounds, big schadenfreude. Perfect for a night with friends who might not stay friends.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build traps and race your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD &amp; BAIL is a 3D party platformer for 2-6 players. Before every race, everyone secretly places a trap or platform on the track, then you all race at the same time. Round after round there are more traps in the way and the race gets more chaotic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How a round works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, each player selects a piece from a random list of all available pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/3b2de6afa6fc89281d90736db3614770.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=421 /></span><br>Then, each player places their piece anywhere on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/c69db8586e3c4c57dceaeb0c1ffac989.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once everything is in place, the new pieces are revealed and the race begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979510/extras/8295b65852f92ba66759ce67fb03caa7.avif?t=1787479234\" width=1232 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your track, your chaos</strong> New traps arrive every round. By the end, the track is a minefield made of your own ideas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A nasty arsenal</strong> Saw blades, pendulums, cannons, wind cannons, jump traps, honey fields, ice patches and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy movement</strong> Double jump, wall jump, dash. Easy to learn, but fast players stay in front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracks that go up</strong> Candy towers, neon rooftops, glaciers, lava fields, desert ruins. Always with multiple routes and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your rules</strong> Score target, rounds, respawns, player collision, sudden death: the host decides how mean it gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character workshop</strong> Colour, hat, face. Look your best before you fall into the lava.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play together</strong> Steam lobbies: invite friends, share a code or open a public lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short rounds, big schadenfreude. Perfect for a night with friends who might not stay friends.</p>", "short_description": "The party platformer where you build the track yourselves: every round a new trap, every race fresh chaos. In the end, all that counts is who reaches the finish first.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong